		description: [
			"Your final challenge waits in Incendium’s Infernal Dunes. Find an Infernal Altar and drop a Nether Star at its center to summon the Hovering Inferno."
			"Bring your best equipment, food and protection. You can attempt the summon whenever you can reach it, but this fight is intended for a fully prepared endgame player."
			"Defeat the first health bar, then survive the final spell while the Inferno is invulnerable. Stay with the encounter until it awards the Fallen to Ashes victory advancement."
			"Claim this quest's victory rewards for the sword Tears for Fears (kubejs:rankers_sword) and four Potions of Radiation. Radiation is harmful. This recovers the original blade and its captured Warden call; the Ring of Ranker comes from a Warden. The later memorial ceremony awakens both relics."
			"The Ranker challenged the Inferno to capture its power and died before succeeding. Prepare before repeating that battle. The twelve NPC stories run in parallel; they do not add a boss-summoning gate."
		]
